Revision history for Moo::LINQ
{{$NEXT}}
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Source role with FromLines, FromCSV, FromTSV
        - Streaming CSV/TSV readers with header detection, custom
          delimiters, and RFC-4180-style quoted-field support
        - Added t/12-source-text.t

0.11    2026-10-09
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Advanced role:
          Chunk, Buffer, Scan, Pairwise, DistinctBy, OrderByCmp,
          Repeat, WhereIndexed, SelectIndexed
        - Updated POD and README with advanced operator reference
        - Added t/11-advanced.t covering all new operators
        - Total: ~59 operators across 11 roles

0.10    2026-10-08
        - Full POD documentation for Moo::LINQ and all role modules
        - Markdown README with real-world log-analysis example
        - Laziness benchmark (bench/laziness.pl)
        - Makefile.PL metadata polish (LICENSE, META_MERGE, provides)
        - Added Changes file
        - Verified clean with podchecker

0.07    2026-10-08
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Quantifiers role:
          Contains, SequenceEqual, ElementAt, ElementAtOrDefault,
          Single, SingleOrDefault, Last, LastOrDefault, DefaultIfEmpty
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Conversion role:
          ToHash, ToJson, ToString, ForEach, Print
        - Added tests t/09-quantifiers.t, t/10-conversion.t

0.06    2026-10-08
        - Fixed Moo::LINQ::Group loading: use Moo::LINQ::Group
          in Grouping.pm and Moo::LINQ.pm
        - Added t/06-grouping.t

0.05    2026-10-08
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Grouping role: GroupBy, ToLookup
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Joining role: Join, GroupJoin, Zip
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Sets role:
          Concat, Union, Intersect, Except
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Group class
        - Added tests t/06-grouping.t, t/07-joining.t, t/08-sets.t

0.04    2026-10-08
        - Added optional third argument to OrderBy / OrderByDescending /
          ThenBy / ThenByDescending: 'auto' | 'numeric' | 'string'
        - Fixed numeric vs. string comparison in sort comparator
        - Removed Iterator::Simple's iterator wrapper in favor of
          plain coderefs throughout (avoids undef-vs-value ambiguity)
        - Fixed Empty() constructor to return a proper iterator
        - Added tests t/04-aggregation.t, t/05-ordering.t

0.03    2026-10-08
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Aggregation role:
          Count, Sum, Average, Min, Max, Aggregate
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Ordering role:
          OrderBy, OrderByDescending, ThenBy, ThenByDescending, Reverse
        - Introduced _sort_spec attribute for ThenBy chaining
        - Made all internal iterators plain coderefs for consistency

0.02    2026-10-08
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Filtering role:
          Where, WhereNot, First, FirstOrDefault, Any, All,
          Take, Skip, TakeWhile, SkipWhile, Distinct
        - Added Moo::LINQ::Projection role:
          Select, SelectMany, Cast
        - Fixed $_ localization in predicates and mappers
        - Fixed SelectMany scalar-context bug: captures mapper output
          in list context, handles arrayref flattening correctly
        - Added tests t/02-filtering.t, t/03-projection.t

0.01    2026-10-08
        - Initial skeleton
        - Core class Moo::LINQ with From, Range, Empty
        - Terminal operators ToArray, ToList
        - Carton setup (cpanfile, cpanfile.snapshot)
        - Basic tests t/01-basic.t
